WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.801
-Welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.602
"The Tonight Show," everyone!

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:05.972
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.140
Well, guys, it's Friday night!

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.909
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.544
The weekend is here.
It's time to check out

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:14.514
New York's newest hot spot
that's open all night long --

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.049
the Javits Center
mass vaccination site!

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:19.218
[ Cheering and applause ]
Ow-w!

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:20.419
-[ Imitates vuvuzela blasting ]

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:21.654
Yeah, since it's Friday,

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.522
let's kick off the weekend
with some good news.

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:25.558
For the first time
since the pandemic began,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.361
a majority of Americans
now believe the COVID situation

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.930
in the United States
is getting better.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.700
That's right, 60% of Americans
are feeling good.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.735
Then, people realized today
was the last episode

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:38.337
of "Wandavision," and that
number dropped to less than 1%.

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.273
[ Laughter ]
But, still.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.275
But, still, moods are
definitely improving.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:45.611
Today, everyone's Apple Watch
was like, "Okay, superstar,

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.313
look who took 14 steps today.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:51.384
[ Laughter and applause ]
Keep up the good work."

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:52.985
Yeah, we're all excited
for a future

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:55.688
that doesn't involve
Clorox-wiping our bananas.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.023
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:00.559
We might even have
a normal summer.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:02.328
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.029
Like like there's a chance --

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:07.066
There's a chance I can be there
in a packed stadium

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.002
the next time Dr. Fauci

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.104
embarrasses himself
with that first pitch.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.872 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Aw.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.440 line:0%
-Bwuh-buh.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:19.712
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.248
Don't worry.
Don't worry.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.983
Why are you worried?
I would never --

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:28.320
I'm not going to show
your pitch.

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:29.989
I'm not going to show it.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.423
-Okay.
-But our director, Alex, might.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:32.792
-Hey, man!

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.193
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.062
-Ah-bweh-weh.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.062
Not quite. Alright.

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:40.399
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:41.634
Ah!

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.002
[ Applause ]
-Not funny.

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:44.871
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.073
-Not only are people
feeling better about COVID,

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:49.208
they're also feeling good
about President Biden.

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:53.279 line:0%
A new AP poll puts his approval
rating at 60%.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.680 line:0%
We're living
through strange times.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.349
60% approve of Biden

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:58.484
and 40% still believe Trump
is president.

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.854
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:03.422
Speaking of Biden, yesterday,
he met with members of the House

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:05.591
to discuss jobs
and infrastructure

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:06.759
and I thought some
of his remarks

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.628
were pretty interesting.
Here, watch this.

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:20.240 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.846 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:34.720
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.921
-That's not all he said.

00:02:35.921 --> 00:02:37.257
Later, this happened.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.898 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.604 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:59.312
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.813
-What?

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.316
[ Laughter ]
It's odd that he was just
talking about that,

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:05.150
but he said other things, too.
Listen.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.352
[ Laughter ]
Here he is, talking about --

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.254
Here he is, talking
about the good old days.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.459 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:20.166 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.004 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.345
[ Applause ]

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:36.616
Finally, he ended the meeting
by --

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.150
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.619
by saying this --

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:51.497 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.034 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:01.274
[ Laughter and applause ]
I'm just surprised
nobody stopped him.

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:03.675
That's just insane, you know?
Anyway.

00:04:03.675 --> 00:04:05.411
Guys, Congress is getting close

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.046
to passing
its COVID relief bill,

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:09.148
but Republican Senator
John Kennedy

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.850
isn't supporting it and he used
a pretty strange phrase

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.652 line:0%
to describe the bill.
Watch this.

00:04:13.652 --> 00:04:15.087 line:0%
-This feels dreadful.

00:04:15.087 --> 00:04:17.823 line:0%
Billions of dollars
to pension programs;

00:04:17.823 --> 00:04:19.592 line:0%
billions of dollars to schools,

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:23.295 line:0%
with no requirement
that they open.

00:04:23.295 --> 00:04:26.199 line:0%
It's an orgy of pork.

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:28.600
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Oh!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.569
-If "orgy of pork"
sounds familiar,

00:04:30.569 --> 00:04:32.871
that's because it's the
newest sandwich at Arby's.

00:04:32.871 --> 00:04:36.976
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:38.243
Some more entertainment news.

00:04:38.243 --> 00:04:40.579
I saw new photos
from the "Space Jam" sequel,

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:42.715
starring LeBron James
was just released.

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.417
But here's what's
making the headlines.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:47.553
The director said that they
decided to make Lola Bunny

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:51.257 line:0%
less sexualized
than in the first movie.

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:52.692 line:0%
And, if you're upset about this,

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:53.793
take a cold shower

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.761
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:57.930
and, while you're in there,
reevaluate your entire life.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:00.233
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:01.868
I just wish Tom Brokaw
hadn't retired

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.969
because I'd love to hear him
read this story, like --

00:05:03.969 --> 00:05:06.372
[ As Brokaw ]
Cartoon vixen Lola Bunny

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:10.409
was redesigned
to reduce her sexual appeal.

00:05:10.409 --> 00:05:12.444
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.444 --> 00:05:13.846
It's been a tough week
for conservatives.

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:15.814
They're like, "We just want
our bunnies sexy,

00:05:15.814 --> 00:05:17.149
our children's books offensive,

00:05:17.149 --> 00:05:18.751
and our potatoes with penises!"

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:22.555
[ Laughter ]
-Oh! Oh!

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:23.689
-And, finally, listen to this --

00:05:23.689 --> 00:05:25.925
there are new photos
of a supersonic jet

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:28.461
that could someday fly
from New York City to London

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:29.828
in 90 minutes.
-Whoo!

00:05:29.828 --> 00:05:31.664
-Check this thing out.

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:34.399
Look at that.
Yeah, it's 90 minutes in the air

00:05:34.399 --> 00:05:35.668
to London,
and then another 90

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:37.403
to get spatula'd
out of your seat.

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:39.072
[ Laughter and applause ]
We have a great show, everyone!

